data: {"answer": "這裡是宴會廳門口，系統要求多因素驗證才能進入。你需要先輸入走廊政策公告上的密碼，再配合你擁有的第二種驗證方式。重點是重要系統不能只靠單一密碼，要防範多因素驗證疲勞攻擊。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "活動報名報到系統是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Event Registration & Check-in do?", "zh": "活動報名報到系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent MFA fatigue (push bombing)?", "zh": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 7.21, "total_s": 7.23}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "door_38d0", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "door_38d0"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.3}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "door_38d0", "label": "Room", "en": "Banquet Hall Door (locked)", "zh": "宴會廳門口（上鎖）"}, {"key": "event_system", "label": "System", "en": "Event Registration & Check-in", "zh": "活動報名報到系統"}, {"key": "mfa_fatigue", "label": "Threat", "en": "MFA Fatigue (Push Bombing)", "zh": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊"}, {"key": "mfa", "label": "Control", "en": "Multi-Factor Authentication", "zh": "多因素驗證"}, {"key": "c_authentication", "label": "Concept", "en": "Authentication Factors", "zh": "驗證因素"}], "edges": [{"a": "event_system", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "door_38d0"}, {"a": "mfa_fatigue", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "door_38d0"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "door_38d0"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "mfa"}, {"a": "mfa", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "door_38d0"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：宴會廳門口・多因素驗證（導覽裡的名稱：宴會廳門口（上鎖））\n這裡講的是：宴會廳的門要兩種驗證：你知道的（走廊政策公告上的密碼）加上你擁有的。\n重點：重要系統不能只靠密碼。\n要繼續往前走：宴會廳的門要輸入密碼，答案在走廊的資安政策公告欄上：先打密碼至少要幾個字元，再打螢幕幾分鐘鎖定。\n這裡的系統：活動報名報到系統\n這裡要注意的威脅：多因素驗證疲勞攻擊\n看得到的防護措施：多因素驗證\n課程概念：驗證因素\n相關的處理流程：收到不是自己發起的多因素驗證通知\n可以走到：宴會廳門口・驗證失敗（導覽裡的名稱：宴會廳門口（密碼錯誤））、資安訓練室", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 7.21, "load_s": 0.02, "prompt_tokens": 711, "prompt_s": 2.78, "gen_tokens": 55, "gen_s": 4.4, "tok_per_s": 12.5, "first_token_s": 2.81}}, "state": {}}

